{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"848","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Goodbye Souvenir"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"6 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"I won't feel lonely, nor will I be sorrowful... not before everything is buried."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A string of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" beads is left as the message of leaving. The beads are numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" from left to right, each having a shape numbered by integers between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" inclusive. Some beads may have the same shapes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of a shape "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" in a certain subsegment of beads, is defined to be the difference between the last position and the first position that shape "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" appears in the segment. The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of a subsegment is the sum of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memories"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" over all shapes that occur in it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"From time to time, shapes of beads change as well as the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memories"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Sometimes, the past secreted in subsegments are being recalled, and you are to find the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for each of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, m ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of beads in the string, and the total number of changes and queries, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the initial shapes of beads "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1, 2, ..., n"},{"kind":"text","text":", respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines each describes either a change in the beads or a query of subsegment. A line has one of the following formats: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1 p x"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ p ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ x ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"), meaning that the shape of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th bead is changed into "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2 l r"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ l ≤ r ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting a query of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the subsegment from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":", inclusive. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, print one line with an integer — the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the recalled subsegment."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7 6\n1 2 3 1 3 2 1\n2 3 7\n2 1 3\n1 7 2\n1 3 2\n2 1 6\n2 5 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n0\n7\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7 5\n1 3 2 1 4 2 3\n1 1 4\n2 2 3\n1 1 7\n2